OL,3,GNEWSALewisham shopping centre
OL,4,Aredevelopment paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA billion-pound redevelopment of
OL,7,FLewisham Shopping Centre has been
OL,8,Fpaused because of "exceptionally
OL,9,Fchallenging economic conditions",
OL,10,Faccording to the centre's owner.
OL,12,FPlans for the 17-acre site, approved by
OL,13,Fthe council in October 2025, included
OL,14,F1,744 homes, student accommodation and
OL,15,Fa new shopping centre.
OL,17,FLandsec said it was "deprioritising"
OL,18,Fthe scheme, adding it was "no secret"
OL,19,Fthat higher interest rates, rising
OL,20,Fconstruction costs and more complex
OL,21,Fregulations had made development in
OL,22,FLondon "increasingly challenging".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
