OL,3,GNEWSALewisham shopping centre
OL,4,Aredevelopment paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision also comes after
OL,7,FLewisham's Green Party-led
OL,8,Fadministration declined to support the
OL,9,Fnext phase of land assembly without a
OL,10,Fsignificant increase in affordable
OL,11,Fhousing.
